{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12128","headline":"山中春仲寄上王恒颍川沈冲 · 钱起","name":"山中春仲寄上王恒颍川沈冲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐者守恬泊，春山日深净。\n谁知蟠木材，得性无人境。\n座隅泉出洞，竹上云起岭。\n饥貁入山厨，饮虹过药井。\n前溪堪放逸，仲月好风景。\n游目来远思，摘芳寄汝颍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}